; The one variable: position, rotation and non-uniform scale on a promoted Control's Node2D ancestor.
; Every other 2D-UI fixture roots at a Control or promotes past an untransformed node. The Panel is
; not square and the small square marks one corner, so a wrong direction or origin moves the group.

